# Agent notes

Notes for coding agents that apply only to this app. AGENTS.md holds the rules shared by every app; this file is where this app's specifics go. Keep it short.

## Folders

<!-- One line per top-level folder, kept current as the app grows. -->

- `docs/`: requirements, plans, decisions and status. Read before working.
- `scripts/`: `check`, `format`, `setup`, `dev` and `publish-github`.
{%- if include_python %}
- `src/{{ package_name }}/`: the Python package.
{%- endif %}
{%- if include_typescript %}
- `src/` (`.ts` files): the TypeScript code.
{%- endif %}
{%- if include_python or include_typescript %}
- `tests/`: the tests.
{%- endif %}

